[Intro]

[Verse 1]
[00:33.77]We rode beyond the line of pines
[00:37.05]Where the birch doth shrink and bow
[00:40.65]Where the moss is the height of the reindeer's knee
[00:44.34]And the bassline runneth from the snow!

[00:47.92]There be no night here, only light
[00:51.57]A sky that doth not close its eye
[00:55.65]The sun is a wolf upon the world
[00:58.88]And the wolf, the wolf doth boogie down!

[Pre-Chorus]
[01:03.18]Beaivi, beaivi
[01:04.63]Sól eigi sefr
[01:06.49]Beaivi, beaivi
[01:08.09]Disco, disco, dance till dawn!

[Chorus]
[01:13.40]Where the sun doth walk the whole night through!
[01:16.88]Where the day doth never end!
[01:20.91]Geassi! Geassi! Náttlaus sól!
[01:24.26]Get thee on the floor with me!
[01:27.54]The dance floor runneth without an end
[01:30.76]The light doth runneth in our veins
[01:35.15]Beaivi! Beaivi! Skál til day!
[01:38.53]Skål to Saturday night fever, friend!

[Verse 2]
[01:47.98]Old Bjarki he hath shed his cloak of fur
[01:51.18]He hath buckled on a polyester shirt
[01:54.70]Young Hrafn on the table is dancing still
[01:58.20]But the table is a lit-up disco floor!

[02:02.42]The vǫlva who did save the spring last year
[02:05.30]Hath returneth with a sequined gown
[02:08.79]She singeth not of seiðr now but groove
[02:12.43]And the groove doth taketh the longhouse down!

[Pre-Chorus]
[02:16.64]Beaivi, beaivi
[02:18.09]Sól eigi sefr
[02:20.00]Beaivi, beaivi
[02:21.66]Disco, disco, dance till dawn!

[Chorus]
[02:26.83]Where the sun doth walk the whole night through!
[02:30.18]Where the day doth never end!
[02:33.97]Geassi! Geassi! Náttlaus sól!
[02:37.39]Get thee on the floor with me!
[02:40.46]The dance floor runneth without an end
[02:44.07]The light doth runneth in our veins
[02:48.37]Beaivi! Beaivi! Skál til day!
[02:51.56]Skål to Saturday night fever, friend!

[Bridge]
[03:22.21]We who knew the way of the doom
[03:25.04]We learned the way to shake the hip
[03:28.50]We who burned the longhouse to the ground
[03:32.22]Now buildeth a discotheque on top!

[Breakdown]
[03:39.26]Get up!
[03:39.85]Beaivi!
[03:46.80]Get up!
[03:47.66]Beaivi!
[03:48.67]Everybody on the floor of the longhouse — get up!

[Final Chorus]
[04:09.08]Where the sun doth walk the whole night through!
[04:12.38]Where the day doth never end!
[04:16.23]Geassi! Geassi! Náttlaus sól!
[04:19.68]Get thee on the floor with me!
[04:22.37]The dance floor runneth without an end
[04:25.55]The light doth runneth in our veins
[04:30.02]Beaivi! Beaivi! Skál til day!
[04:33.15]Skål to Saturday night fever, friend!

[Outro]
[04:38.60]Vér erum dansa
[04:41.10]Vér erum dansa
[04:44.60]Vér erum DANSA!



